# Split rows and Split items (reference/common/breaks.md#breaks-in-stack-grid-and-table). Page area of 260 × 160
# from (20, 20); grid columns of (260 − 10) / 2 = 125 at x = 20 and 155.
#
# Page 1: head (100) leaves 60. The first row of g (g1 200, g2 30) does not fit in them and, with Split rows by
#   default, is split on this page: g1 places 60 and g2 fits whole.
# Page 2: g1 continues from the top (60) and the second row (g3) goes after it, with the gap of 10: at 70.
#   g ends at 90 and leaves 70 to h, whose first row (100) does not fit: with Split rows: false it moves whole.
# Page 3: h (100, with h1 and h2) leaves 60. The line of s (s1 90, s2 20) does not fit and is split: s1 places 60
#   and s2 fits whole (Split items by default).
# Page 4: s1 continues (30). The table t leaves its first row (40) on this page; the second (t3 120, t4 20) does not
#   fit in the 90 left, and its Row has Keep together: true, so its cells cannot be split: the break before the row
#   is better and the row moves whole.
# Page 5: the second row of t, whole: t3 120 and t4 20 in cells stretched to the row.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Block:
			Id: head
			Box:
				Height: 100
				Background: #F1EFE8
		Grid:
			Id: g
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 10
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: g1
					Box:
						Height: 120
						Background: #E1F0E8
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: g2
					Box:
						Height: 30
						Background: #E1E8F0
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: g3
					Box:
						Height: 20
						Background: #F0E8E1
		Grid:
			Id: h
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 10
			Split rows: false
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: h1
					Box:
						Height: 100
						Background: #E1F0E8
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: h2
					Box:
						Height: 30
						Background: #E1E8F0
		Stack:
			Id: s
			Gap: 10
			Item:
				Block:
					Id: s1
					Box:
						Width: 100
						Height: 90
						Background: #E1F0E8
			Item:
				Block:
					Id: s2
					Box:
						Width: 100
						Height: 20
						Background: #E1E8F0
		Table:
			Id: t
			Column sizes: * *
			Body rows:
				Row:
					Cell:
						Block:
							Id: t1
							Box:
								Height: 40
								Background: #E1F0E8
					Cell:
						Block:
							Id: t2
							Box:
								Height: 40
								Background: #E1E8F0
				Row:
					Break:
						Keep together: true
					Cell:
						Block:
							Id: t3
							Box:
								Height: 120
								Background: #E1F0E8
					Cell:
						Block:
							Id: t4
							Box:
								Height: 20
								Background: #E1E8F0
